Entry-level / graduate roles: ~€35,000 – €50,000

Software Engineer (average): ~€55,000 – €63,000

Senior Software Engineer: ~€60,000 – €90,000

Consultants / Managers: ~€60,000 – €70,000+

Top experienced roles: can go up to €100,000+

